    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Tokens Produzidos\n```json\n{\n  \"code\": 200,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"tokens\": {\n      \"access_token\": \"eyJhbG...\",\n      \"refresh_token\": \"d5f8f01...\",\n      \"token_type\": \"bearer\"\n    },\n    \"tokens_control\": {\n      \"refresh_token_hash\": \"2f3e3...\",\n      \"familia_id\": \"6d69...\"\n    },\n    \"payload\": {\n      \"sub\": \"5bba249e-56a0-47ca-998f-55f4301a24e1\",\n      \"iss\": \"ciacuidadores\",\n      \"aud\": \"primecare\",\n      \"exp\": 1761782457,\n      \"iat\": 1761696057,\n      \"jti\": \"316c75d2-44fc-4d21-ae4a-462519e37418\",\n      \"tenant\": [ 1, 18, 19, 12, 8, 13 ],\n      \"roles\": [ 'admin' ],\n      \"name\": \"GUGA CODER\",\n      \"email\": \"guga.coder@gmail.com\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n",
