    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Payload Esperado como Parâmetro\n\nO conteúdo pode ser enviado **diretamente** no corpo da requisição ou **encapsulado** em uma propriedade `data` ou `payload`.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sub\": \"5bba249e-56a0-47ca-998f-55f4301a24e1\",\n  \"iss\": \"ciacuidadores\",\n  \"aud\": \"primecare\",\n  \"exp\": 1761782048,\n  \"iat\": 1761695648,\n  \"jti\": \"316c75d2-44fc-4d21-ae4a-462519e37418\",\n  \"tenant\": [1, 18, 19, 12, 8, 13],\n  \"roles\": [\"admin\"],\n  \"name\": \"GUGA CODER\",\n  \"email\": \"guga.coder@gmail.com\"\n}\n```\n\nou\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": { \"sub\"... }\n}\n```\n\nou\n\n```json\n{\n  \"payload\": { \"sub\"... }\n}\n```\n\nou\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": { \"payload\": { \"sub\"... } }\n}\n```\n",
        "height": 1200,
        "width": 800,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1568,
        -1072
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "c652e617-6723-4c24-b6e9-aa1ba5b2247f",
      "name": "Sticky Note6"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Loop over input items and add a new field called 'myNewField' to the JSON of each one\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  item.json = item.json.data?.payload\n      || item.json.data\n      || item.json.payload\n      || item.json\n}\n\nreturn $input.all();"
      },
